# The image needs the package, its catalog and the web app sources. Nothing else enters the
# build context, which keeps builds fast and keeps local databases and secrets out of layers.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/
!catalog/
!web/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store

# Built output and generated data; the server answers /api and /feeds live.
web/node_modules
web/.next
web/out
web/public/api
web/public/feeds
web/public/data
web/public/duckdb
web/*.tsbuildinfo
web/next-env.d.ts
